# PVS-Studio configuration for NK / NumKit
# Syntax reference: https://pvs-studio.com/en/docs/manual/0038/

# ── Excluded directories (dependencies, build outputs, disposable corpus) ──
//-V::1,2,3:build
//-V::1,2,3:thirdparty
//-V::1,2,3:ide
//-V::1,2,3:node_modules
//-V::1,2,3:fieldtest
//-V::1,2,3:.vs

# ── General noise suppressions ──
# V807: Decreased performance. Pointer/reference could be used to avoid repeated dereference (often optimized by compiler).
//-V::807
# V823: Decreased performance. Object is temporary and could be eliminated.
//-V::823
# V826: Decreased performance. Consider reserving memory in std::vector (minor micro-hints in non-hot paths).
//-V::826
# V837: An empty/trivial std::move has no effect.
//-V::837

# ── Path-specific suppressions ──
# V550: Comparing real numbers with == or !=.
# In core interpreter and math routines, exact float equality is intentional (e.g. floor(x) == x, exp == 2.0 fast paths).
//-V::550:src/core/
//-V::550:src/toolboxes/math/
